  {
    "id": "anno-ogi_upper_p075_right-14",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "（十三石二斗二升五合四勺四才）　合米　二萬六千二百五十三石七斗一升五合八勺五才"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "（十三石二斗二升五合四勺四才）　合米　二万六千二百五十三石七斗一升五合八勺五才"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Combined rice total: 26,253.71585 koku, which is exactly the regular land tax rice (26,213.22544) plus the rice equivalent of the silver tax (40.49041). A second figure stands in the gutter to the right of this column in round brackets, （十三石二斗二升五合四勺四才）. Its opening bracket begins at y 2013, immediately below the 百 of the main figure, which ends at y 2015 — so it offers an alternative ending for the same number: read as 二萬六千二百 followed by 十三石二斗二升五合四勺四才 it gives 26,213.22544, which is the 正租現米 figure above unchanged. The printed main reading is the one the arithmetic supports. The bracket sits inside this box because its glyph column interleaves with the 合米 column; the two cannot be boxed apart without cutting 5-14 px off one or the other. MASTER records neither the bracket nor its value."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "合米"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
